Derived Microban hardware part
Copyright (c) 2026 Marc Duclusaud (original foot), modifications 2026 Masaaki Hijikata

foot_sole80.stl / foot_sole80.step are Microban's cad/step/foot.step
(https://github.com/Rhoban/microban, commit d0a128d180ecfce69eaaf31b295a0fce31280bfd)
with 10 mm cut off the toe end of the sole plate, so that the ground-contact
plate is 80 mm long (ROBO-ONE Light: at most 55 % of the leg length). Nothing
else is changed. The cut is made by tools/make_parts.py from the original STEP.

